{"id":"A2-L085","title":"Verb + object + bare infinitive: use","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U06","focus":"Verb + object + bare infinitive — uso","targets":{"grammar":"Verb + object + bare infinitive — uso","pron":"Schwa /ə/","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["creative","flexible","ceremony","surprise party","camping trip","beach day","game night","study group","language course","scholarship","career change","savings goal","moving day","new job","fresh start","second chance"],"field":"Planos","genre":"Entrevista","skill":"Fala","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 85 · Verb + object + bare infinitive: use","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verb + object + bare infinitive — uso.","**Pronúncia:** Schwa /ə/.","**10 palavras novas** (planos).","**Texto do dia:** entrevista."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar make, let, have e help sem to numa entrevista."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["creative","criativo"],["flexible","flexível"],["ceremony","ceremony"],["surprise party","surprise party"],["camping trip","camping trip"],["beach day","beach day"],["game night","game night"],["study group","study group"],["language course","language course"],["scholarship","scholarship"],["career change","career change"],["savings goal","savings goal"],["moving day","moving day"],["new job","new job"],["fresh start","fresh start"],["second chance","second chance"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An interview","blocks":[{"type":"iv","intro":"A manager talks about her team.","qa":[["Reporter: What do you do for your team?","I **let** them **choose** their hours and **help** them **learn** new tools."],["Reporter: Do you ever make them work late?","No! I **make** them **take** breaks. I **have** the system **send** reminders."],["Reporter: What do you want from them?","I **want** them **to be** creative."]],"gloss":[["tool","ferramenta"],["reminder","lembrete"],["creative","criativo"],["hours","horário"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The manager lets the team choose hours.","ans":"T","why":"let them choose."},{"q":"She makes them work late.","ans":"F","why":"make them take breaks."},{"q":"She wants them to be creative.","ans":"T","why":"to be creative."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“tool” = ?","opts":["ferramenta","torre","tarefa"],"ans":0,"why":"tool."},{"q":"“creative” = ?","opts":["criativo","cruel","crítico"],"ans":0,"why":"creative."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Bare infinitive after make / let / have / help","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["let","**I let them choose.**"],["make","**I make them take breaks.**"],["have (causativo)","**I have the system send reminders.**"],["help","**I help them learn.**"]],"cap":"Bare infinitive after make / let / have / help"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Com *want, ask, tell, expect* use **to**; com *make, let, have* **sem to**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I let them ___ their hours. (choose)","a":"choose","why":"sem to."},{"s":"I make them ___ breaks. (take)","a":"take","why":"sem to."},{"s":"I have the system ___ reminders. (send)","a":"send","why":"sem to."},{"s":"I want them ___ creative. (be)","a":"to be","why":"want + to."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["manager","gerente"],["team","equipe"],["tool","ferramenta"],["reminder","lembrete"],["creative","criativo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["them","choose","Yes","I","let"],"ans":"Yes I let them choose","pt":"Sim, deixo."},{"words":["breaks","I","make","them","take"],"ans":"I make them take breaks","pt":"Faço com que parem."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"creative","pos":"word","pt":"criativo","ex":"A creative idea.","expt":"Uma ideia criativa."},{"w":"flexible","pos":"word","pt":"flexível","ex":"A flexible job.","expt":"Um emprego flexível."},{"w":"ceremony","pos":"word","pt":"ceremony","ex":"cerimônia","expt":"A graduation ceremony."},{"w":"surprise party","pos":"word","pt":"surprise party","ex":"festa surpresa","expt":"A surprise party."},{"w":"camping trip","pos":"word","pt":"camping trip","ex":"viagem de camping","expt":"A camping trip."},{"w":"beach day","pos":"word","pt":"beach day","ex":"dia de praia","expt":"A beach day."},{"w":"game night","pos":"word","pt":"game night","ex":"noite de jogos","expt":"A game night."},{"w":"study group","pos":"word","pt":"study group","ex":"grupo de estudo","expt":"A study group."},{"w":"language course","pos":"word","pt":"language course","ex":"curso de idioma","expt":"A language course."},{"w":"scholarship","pos":"word","pt":"scholarship","ex":"bolsa","expt":"A full scholarship."},{"w":"career change","pos":"word","pt":"career change","ex":"mudança de carreira","expt":"A career change."},{"w":"savings goal","pos":"word","pt":"savings goal","ex":"meta de economia","expt":"A savings goal."},{"w":"moving day","pos":"word","pt":"moving day","ex":"dia da mudança","expt":"Moving day is Friday."},{"w":"new job","pos":"word","pt":"new job","ex":"novo emprego","expt":"A new job."},{"w":"fresh start","pos":"word","pt":"fresh start","ex":"recomeço","expt":"A fresh start."},{"w":"second chance","pos":"word","pt":"second chance","ex":"segunda chance","expt":"A second chance."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Don’t overdo it.** — Não exagere.","**Take it easy.** — Vá com calma.","**Trust the process.** — Confie no processo.","**Do you let them choose their hours?** — Você deixa escolherem o horário?","**Yes, I let them choose.** — Sim, deixo.","**What do you make them do?** — O que você faz eles fazerem?","**Don’t get me wrong.** — Não me leve a mal."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"arrange","pt":"organizar","forms":[["I / you / we / they arrange","I arrange a trip."],["he / she / it arranges","He arranges a party."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Team talk","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Team talk","lines":[["Reporter","Do you let them choose their hours?","Você deixa escolherem o horário?"],["Manager","Yes, I let them choose.","Sim, deixo."],["Reporter","What do you make them do?","O que você faz eles fazerem?"],["Manager","I make them take breaks.","Faço com que parem."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Schwa /ə/","items":[{"label":"Schwa /ə/","note":"Vogais fracas viram /ə/: about, banana, today, the.","words":["about","banana","today","family","another"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what your boss lets you do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"My boss lets me leave early."},{"q":"Say what makes you smile.","pt":"Diga.","model":"Music makes me smile."},{"q":"Say what you help others do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I help my friends learn."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with let / make / have / help.","model":"I let them choose their hours. I make them take breaks. I have the system send reminders. I help them learn new tools. I want them to be creative.","checklist":["Usei **let/make/have/help**","Sem **to**","Usei **want to**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “manager” mean?","opts":["equipe","lembrete","gerente"],"ans":2,"why":"**manager** = gerente."},{"q":"What does “team” mean?","opts":["equipe","ferramenta","criativo"],"ans":0,"why":"**team** = equipe."},{"q":"What does “tool” mean?","opts":["lembrete","ferramenta","flexível"],"ans":1,"why":"**tool** = ferramenta."},{"q":"What does “reminder” mean?","opts":["criativo","confiança","lembrete"],"ans":2,"why":"**reminder** = lembrete."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}